,"output_tokens":84.44444444444444,"requests":1},"project.symbol-reference-completeness":{"cache_read_tokens":0.0,"cache_write_tokens":0.0,"input_tokens":7086.0,"llm_calls":1,"output_tokens":395.0,"requests":1}}}},"findings":[{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Pin the `gh api` flag mechanism for `environment_ids` (a JSON array of integers, e.g. `-F environment_ids='[<id>]'` / `-F state=approved -f comment=...` or `--input`) in the recipe, and strengthen AC #1 to verify the array-typed form rather than the bare substring `environment_ids`.","cohort":["T3"],"criteria":["T3"],"decision":"block","decision_margin":0.1,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Approach: 'a complete `gh api --method POST .../pending_deployments` invocation including its required body (`environment_ids`, `state`, `comment`)'","AC #1: 'the matching command block contains `state=approved` and `environment_ids`' — a substring grep that does not distinguish a string-typed `-f environment_ids=N` (rejected by the API) from a JSON-array `-F environment_ids='[N]'`","gh-api flag semantics: `-f/--field` sends string values; JSON arrays of integers require `-F/--raw-field` with a JSON literal or `--input` — a flag-level correctness constraint the plan leaves unspecified"],"finding":"The plan requires a 'complete, runnable' `gh api --method POST .../pending_deployments` recipe with an `environment_ids` body field, but does not pin the gh-api flag mechanism that makes `environment_ids` a JSON array of integers. With `gh api`, plain `-f`/`--field environment_ids=N` sends the value as a string and the API rejects it (typed-body mismatch); an integer array requires `-F`/`--raw-field` with a JSON literal or `--input`. The AC only greps for the literal substring `environment_ids`, so a wrong-typed recipe would pass the AC yet fail at runtime.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f70dc314b5cc56bda","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach bullet 'How to approve non-interactively'; Acceptance Criteria #1","norm_id":"n6c93a6fb557c4b6c","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An operator copies the shipped recipe using `-f environment_ids=123` and the approval POST returns 422 (invalid body), stalling the release at the exact step the doc rewrite was meant to unblock."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Specify the recipe as `gh api --method POST repos/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/<run_id>/pending_deployments -F environment_ids='[<env_id>]' -f state=approved -f comment='...'` (note `-F` for the JSON integer array), and change AC #1 to assert the array-typed field, not just the literal `environment_ids` string.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add an AC assertion that docs/releasing.md documents the companion GET (environment id discovery) and the `--method POST` invocation, not only `state=approved`/`environment_ids`.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5d","T7"],"criteria":["E1","